## Future Development Opportunities

Potential enhancements to the concept include:

- Integrating live ADS-B data feeds.
- Incorporating physical optical vehicle detection sensors.
- Combining aircraft and vehicle detection into a unified monitoring system.
- Developing a real-time visual monitoring interface.
- Testing the system against simulated runway conflict scenarios.

*This project was an academic engineering prototype and conceptual safety system, not a certified or operational aviation safety solution.*

